              "textKey": "semantic.navigation.orders.warm.01"
            },
            "text": {
              "EN": "Sure. What do you need?",
              "TL": "Sige. Ano ang kailangan mo?"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "warm.02",
            "metadata": {
              "style": "warm",
              "textKey": "semantic.navigation.orders.warm.02"
            },
            "text": {
              "EN": "Whatever you need, I'm glad to help.",
              "TL": "Kahit ano'ng kailangan mo, masaya akong tumulong."
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "warm.03",
            "metadata": {
              "style": "warm",
              "textKey": "semantic.navigation.orders.warm.03"
            },
            "text": {
              "EN": "Just tell me what to do and I'll see to it.",
              "TL": "Sabihin mo lang kung ano'ng gagawin at ako na ang bahala."
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "warm.04",
            "metadata": {
              "style": "warm",
              "textKey": "semantic.navigation.orders.warm.04"
            },
            "text": {
              "EN": "Ready to work together. What's the plan?",
              "TL": "Handang magtulungan. Ano'ng plano?"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "warm.05",
            "metadata": {
              "style": "warm",
              "textKey": "semantic.navigation.orders.warm.05"
            },
            "text": {
              "EN": "What would you like me to take care of?",
              "TL": "Ano ang gusto mong asikasuhin ko?"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "warm.06",
            "metadata": {
              "style": "warm",
              "textKey": "semantic.navigation.orders.warm.06"
            },
            "text": {
              "EN": "Always happy to lend a hand. What's the task?",
              "TL": "Laging handang tumulong. Ano'ng gawain?"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "warm.07",
            "metadata": {
              "style": "warm",
              "textKey": "semantic.navigation.orders.warm.07"
            },
            "text": {
              "EN": "Tell me how I can help you right now.",
              "TL": "Sabihin mo kung paano ako makakatulong sa'yo ngayon."
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "warm.08",
            "metadata": {
              "style": "warm",
              "textKey": "semantic.navigation.orders.warm.08"
            },
            "text": {
              "EN": "I'm with you all the way. What do you need?",
              "TL": "Kasama mo ako sa lahat. Ano'ng kailangan mo?"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "warm.09",
            "metadata": {
              "style": "warm",
              "textKey": "semantic.navigation.orders.warm.09"
            },
            "text": {
              "EN": "Happy to follow your lead. What's next?",
              "TL": "Masayang sumunod sa pamumuno mo. Ano'ng susunod?"
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "warm.10",
            "metadata": {
              "style": "warm",
              "textKey": "semantic.navigation.orders.warm.10"
            },
            "text": {
              "EN": "Give me a job and I'll do my best.",
              "TL": "Bigyan mo ako ng gawain at gagawin ko ang makakaya ko."
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "namespace": "semantic.navigation.orders"
    },
